Pr txBox="true"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm rot="0"><a:off x="339388" y="2726679"/><a:ext cx="17948612" cy="976675"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr anchor="t" rtlCol="false" tIns="0" lIns="0" bIns="0" rIns="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l" marL="604516" indent="-302258" lvl="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="3919"/></a:lnSpc><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" b="true" sz="2799"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Weakened Ecosystem Feedback Loop: The absence of a robust alumni-mentor presence prevents the continuous flow of industry trends back into the institution, widening the gap between academic theory and real-world market demands.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr name="TextBox 5" id="5"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="true"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm rot="0"><a:off x="339388" y="4484403"/><a:ext cx="17948612" cy="1471997"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr anchor="t" rtlCol="false" tIns="0" lIns="0" bIns="0" rIns="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l" marL="604516" indent="-302258" lvl="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="3919"/></a:lnSpc><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" b="true" sz="2799"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Missed Investment and Networking Opportunities: The lack of a structured participation framework limits the potential for alumni to serve as early-stage investors or strategic partners, which are critical for the long-term sustainability of the incubation hub.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr name="TextBox 6" id="6"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="true"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm rot="0"><a:off x="211976" y="7089512"/><a:ext cx="17886243" cy="850812"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr anchor="t" rtlCol="false" tIns="0" lIns="0" bIns="0" rIns="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l" marL="539748" indent="-269874" lvl="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="3499"/></a:lnSpc><a:buFont typeface="Arial"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" b="true" sz="2499"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="000000"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:ea typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:cs typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/><a:sym typeface="Cormorant Garamond Bold"/></a:rPr><a:t>Communication Gaps: Alumni often don't know exactly how or when they can help. Without a clear "call to action" or a simple way to sign up, even those who want to volunteer end up staying on the sidelines.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>